{"id":"n84247-1-8","stage":2,"title":"할인점 · 折扣店","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84247-1-8-1","ko":"이번에 할인점에서 신발을 아주 싸게 샀어.","zh":"这次我在折扣店以非常低的价格买了鞋子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할인점에서","meaning":"折扣店，打折店，打折商店","explanation":"할인점：折扣店，打折店，打折商店；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"할인점","audio":"/audio/ffd3026621f7fe657bd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84247","senseId":"1","lemma":"할인점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신발을","meaning":"鞋","explanation":"신발：鞋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"신발","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30213","senseId":"1","lemma":"신발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸게","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀어.","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"ffd3026621f7fe65","term":"할인점","zh":"折扣店，打折店，打折商店","audio":"/audio/ffd3026621f7fe657bd9.mp3","entryId":"84247","definition":"专卖比原定价格低的商品的店。","pronunciation":["하린점"]},{"id":"514d3c6f08937125","term":"신발","zh":"鞋","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3","entryId":"30213","definition":"站立或走路时为了保护脚而穿的东西。","pronunciation":["신발"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"便宜，贱","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"29718","definition":"价格低于一般价位。","pronunciation":["싸다"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9825ab60b7958bd7ef56.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84247-1-8-2","ko":"그래? 다음에 나도 거기에서 사야겠어.","zh":"是吗？那我下次也打算去那儿买。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음에","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거기에서","meaning":"那儿，那里","explanation":"거기：那儿，那里；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62258","senseId":"2","lemma":"거기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사야겠어.","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8c91c4ef7e321cf6","term":"거기","zh":"那儿，那里","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3","entryId":"62258","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的地方。","pronunciation":["거기"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ca1488cfeca134c059d0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.15,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84247","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":72,"sequenceScore":1.9767,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？那我下次也打算去那儿买。","您用完餐了吗？要上餐后饮品或甜点吗？","这次我在折扣店以非常低的价格买了鞋子。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是吗？那我下次也打算去那儿买。","这次我在折扣店以非常低的价格买了鞋子。","您用完餐了吗？要上餐后饮品或甜点吗？"],"answer":0}]}
